  Slug: cannoneer
  DisplayName: Cannoneer
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You served as a crewmate aboard a military vessel or pirate ship and
    were responsible for the use and maintenance of the ship's cannons. A strong
    back and quick reflexes were equally important to you in your duties, and you
    know your way around explosives and the dangers that lie therein. These skills
    serve you well in your new life as an adventurer, as compared to the weight of
    a cannon, a gear load that makes your allies blanche just makes you laugh instead.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One boost must be to Dexterity or Strength , and
    one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Athletics skill and the
    Warfare Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hefty Hauler]
    skill feat.
